;RESIDUES B 402 - B 409 INCLUSIVE HAVE BEEN GIVEN ZERO OCCUPANCY AS THERE WAS NO INTERPRETABLE ELECTRON DENSITY IN THIS REGION. THE POSITIONS OF SIDE CHAIN ATOMS WITH TEMPERATURE FACTORS GREATER THAN 75 IS UNCERTAIN. THE MAIN CHAIN CONFORMATION IS ALSO UNCERTAIN FOR REGIONS WITH TEMPERATURE FACTORS ABOVE 60. THE PEPTIDE BOND BETWEEN ASP 269 AND ASP 270 IN CHAINS A, B, C AND THE PEPTIDE BOND BETWEEN ASP 256 AND ASN 257 IN CHAINS D, E, AND F HAVE BEEN MODELED IN A CIS CONFORMATION.
;
